WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/ai/AIGeofenceAwareAutomationSuggestions.tsx — an AI feature panel:
    withAiFeature('geofence-aware-automation-suggestions')(            ← ABSENT when AI off (ADR-015 §I5)
      AIFeatureCard( title + Helix badge + description
                     inputSlot = <Textarea prompt/>
                     button   = universal "Ask Helix" / "Helix is thinking…", disabled COMPUTED
                                (!canStart || streaming), never literal disabled
                     children = captured proposal: "Proposed automation" → name|"(unnamed)" → description?
                                → Triggers:N · Conditions:N · Actions:N → validation_error? → rejected?
                                → "Apply to form" (disabled unless status==='ok')
                     AiOutputPanel( stream.text/state/error ) ))
    Stream: useAiStream POST /ai/geofences/automations/draft (vehicle_id + prompt in the JSON body).
    Capture: tool_result(name=draft_automation_graph, ok) → normalizeAutomationInput(data.draft) →
             AutomationDraft{draft,status,validation_error}; status==='ok' gates apply.
    Lifecycle: cancel()+reset draft on vehicleId change / unmount; canStart = vehicleId>0 && prompt!=='' &&
             state!=='paused-confirm'; suggest() is a no-op while busy; apply() copies graph to parent form
             (propose-only — the baseline AutomationBuilder Save is the sole write path, ADR-015 §I3/§I8).

